	<!--<newsletter id="5" date="11/11/2009"><![CDATA[Check out the new Greek themed decor items! Time for an Ancient Greece themed party perhaps? Toga! Toga! Toga!\\n\\nFinally, just a quick reminder that you can bookmark Restaurant City, to make sure you can easily find your way back!]]></newsletter> -->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="6" date="17/11/2009"><![CDATA[Not long ago we asked you what decor theme you'd like to see in Restaurant City. "Underwater!" you told us. Well underwater you shall have! Check out the stores!\\n\\nOh and just another quick reminder to bookmark Restaurant City just to make sure you can find it easily again!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="7" date="24/11/2009"><![CDATA[We've added even more new dishes today so if you'd like to unlock them better get going because they'll be gone on the 1st of December!\\n\\nWe've also added a new ingredient which'll help you with those new dishes. Guess what it is? Here's a clue: Thanksgiving!\\n\\nThere's new goodies in the shops too. Check out the Fall themed items, and the new game to play on the Snake arcade machine!\\n\\nRemember to bookmark!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="8" date="01/12/2009"><![CDATA[Well folks, this may be the most feature packed week we've ever had!\\n\\nFirst there are new holiday dishes. Unlock them quick, they won't be there forever!\\n\\nNext we've added an outside area for dining al fresco.\\n\\nThere is also a rumor going round that a mysterious character calling himself the Food King has been sighted! There\uFFFDs a special surprise for your friends if you find him!\\n\\nAnd if you enjoy Restaurant City, you should check out <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/petsociety/?pf_ref=x1043" target="_blank">Pet Society</a></font></u> by Playfish! Click <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/petsociety/?pf_ref=x1043" target="_blank">here</a></font></u> to play!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="9" date="08/12/2009"><![CDATA[The holiday period is a busy time for any popular restaurant. With friends, families and colleagues enjoying festive meals together, the added workload can put a strain on your restaurant and staff.\\n\\nThe good news is we've taken a shipment of upgraded stoves and drinks machines (the Festive Stove and Festive Drinks Machine) which will definitely lighten your load. How? They run 10% faster!\\n\\nPS - Gourmet Street is now open for business again!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="10" date="15/12/2009"><![CDATA[We've just introduced festive beds which are so comfortable that your staff will get fully rested twice as fast! There are also festive toilets which, well, hmm... they're twice as fast too, let's leave it at that.\\n\\nWe've also added a whole host of decorative items to make the outside of your restaurant look so good the customers will roll in to give you a good rating!\\n\\nFinally a quick reminder to go check out <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/countrystory/?pf_ref=x1037" target="_blank">Country Story</a></font></u> it's full of cool new cool features and items to help you grow crops and get farming!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="11" date="22/12/2009"><![CDATA[There's an icy theme in Restaurant City this week, so there's all kinds of super cool items to turn your restaurant into an ice palace!\\n\\nThere are new functional items to discover -- a Reindeer which increases the maximum popularity of your restaurant (which means more people will come to eat at your restaurant!) and a Santa Statue which turns all your customers into Santas and elves! Ho ho ho!\\n\\nHappy Holidays!\\n\\nIf you enjoy Restaurant City, you should check out <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/petsociety/?pf_ref=x1043" target="_blank">Pet Society</a></font></u> by Playfish! Click <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/petsociety/?pf_ref=x1043" target="_blank">here</a></font></u> to play!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="12" date="29/12/2009"><![CDATA[Well, the holiday season is almost done but the new year is still to come and we've got a bumper week of cool stuff for you to celebrate with!\\n\\nThere's a snow machine, balloons, firework decorations, a massive cake and, er, a lobster holding a champagne bottle. Don't know about you, but the way I see it, if there ain't no lobster with a champagne bottle, there ain't no party.\\n\\nHappy New Year!\\n\\nIf you enjoy Restaurant City, you should check out <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/petsociety/?pf_ref=x1043" target="_blank">Pet Society</a></font></u> by Playfish! Click <u><font color="#0000FF"><a href="http://apps.facebook.com/petsociety/?pf_ref=x1043" target="_blank">here</a></font></u> to play!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="13" date="05/01/2010"><![CDATA[Happy New Year!\\n\\nThe holidays might be almost over, but the crowds are as hungry as ever in Restaurant City. This week Ancient Egypt is all the rage. There are pyramids, a boat, exotic plants for the garden and some cool statues. Be sure to check out the new items!\\n\\nIt's been a busy holiday season in Restaurant City. Head down to Gourmet Street and you will witness the awesome creativity of the top-rated restaurants in the city!\\n\\nHappy cooking!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="14" date="12/01/2010"><![CDATA[Yeehaw! The Wild West just came to Restaurant City! Deck your restaurant out like a real saloon complete with swing doors, a fast cooking grill and a cowboy! There's even a rootin' tootin' new dish to learn - Spicy Buffalo Wings, real fine!\\n\\nBut that's not all! There's a crazy sale on garden extensions! We've slashed prices by 50% for the next two weeks, so expand your turf while you can!\\n\\nHappy cooking cowboys and cowgirls!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="15" date="12/01/2010"><![CDATA[This week there's a big reward for our faithful fans - an exclusive statue that boosts your restaurant's popularity.\\n\\n<u><font color="#3366FF">Click here to claim yours now!</font></u>]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="16" date="19/01/2010"><![CDATA[It's anchors away as we set sail for Pirate Week! You'll find all the pirate items you need, from cutlasses and gold doubloons to the Jolly Roger, in stores now!\\n\\nThere's still time to become a fan of Restaurant City and <u><font color="#3366FF"><a href="http://www.facebook.com/restaurantcity" target="_blank">claim the exclusive statue</a></font></u> which increases your restaurant's popularity! What's popularity? Well, the higher it is, the more customers come to your restaurant. And the more customers that come, the more money you can make!\\n\\nFinally just a reminder that you've got just one more week to buy outside areas at HALF the normal price! Get them while they're hot!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="17" date="19/01/2010"><![CDATA[The people of Haiti need us. If $100,000 in donations are made through our Mercy Corps donation site all players will receive a special item to say thank you. Every donation helps!\\n\\nClick here to donate: <u><font color="#3366FF"><a href="http://www.mercycorps.org/fundraising/playfish" target="_blank">http://www.mercycorps.org/fundraising/playfish</a></font></u>]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="18" date="26/01/2010"><![CDATA[Big News! If you love your current restaurant design but really want to redecorate - now you can do both! Save different layouts and switch between them. These unlock at levels 10 and 20. Now you can have themes for all moods!\\n\\nNew recipes to learn this week -- the famous Pad Thai and a good old-fashioned Ham & Cheese Sandwich!\\n\\nThere are also new items in the shops, classic black furniture, poker chips, dubious violin cases and some sharp wiseguy suits for your staff. Everything you need to turn your restaurant into a speakeasy fit for the godfather.\\n\\nBon appetit!]]></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="19" date="02/02/2010"></newsletter>-->\r
	<!--<newsletter id="20" date="09/02/2010"></newsletter>-->
	<!--<newsletter id="21" date="21/10/2026"><![CDATA[Testing Testing 123]]></newsletter>-->
